WEBVTT

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:06.210
Nice! Keep going! It's working!
Just believe and it'll happen!

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.830
HOCUS FOCUUUUUUUS!

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.580
Great! Everything looks okay!

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.920
Thanks for your help!

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.960
After 10 long years...

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.630
The cherry tree who took a leaf of absence
is back to protect your city!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.790
Magical Girl Sakura Chiyoda
has just arrived on the scene!

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:34.960
<b>DIIIING...</b>

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.130
C'mon, let's shake hands.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:37.790
Huh?

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.000
Thanks for being such a help to my little sister Momo!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.040
WHAAAAAAAAT?!

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.170
<b>W</b>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.170
<b>H</b>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.170
<b>A</b>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.170
<b>A</b>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.170
<b>A</b>

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.170
<b>T</b>

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:59.210
The excitement has just begun!

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:06.750
I have a feeling that a miracle will occur

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:14.000
A novice's skill is enough. Now, let's go!

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:16.960
It's all or nothing. We can go anywhere

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:21.670
Let me hear more even the sound of the core

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:26.460
If you and I put our hands together, there is nothing to fear

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:28.960
When I'm at a loss what to do,

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:35.080
I'll remember that you are here for me

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:42.580
You and I look up at the same sky

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:47.000
We smile at each other and overcome hardship, too

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:52.250
Doing our best for someone

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.830
Isn't bad, too,

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:59.420
We are side by side again today

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:06.630
The excitement has just begun

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:19.000
<b>VOW UNDER THE SETTING SUN!</b>

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:19.000
<b>THE PATH FORWARD FOR DEMONKIND</b>

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:24.920
Sakura... Chiyoda...

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.000
Amazing! My mission was a huge success!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:33.750
<b>WOOOOOOOOW</b>

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:33.710
I never thought you'd appear out of nowhere
when I was just looking for clues about your core!

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.540
Momo will be so happy to see you!

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.500
Let's hurry and get outta this place!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.880
Ah, actually I'm just...!

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:38.880
Gotta go! Gotta go!

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:41.000
Oh. But I don't know how to get back...

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.460
Hold on a second!

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:44.420
Just wait! Calm yourself down!

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:44.210
<b>Tug</b>

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:45.960
Not the horn handles!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.380
This form hasn't totally solidified,
so I'll disappear if you start to get all hyper on me.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.420
S-sorry! Please don't disappear!

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.920
<b>BANDA TERRACE</b>

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.170
We're going to brainstorm a way to save Shamiko!

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:56.750
Okay, but...

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:59.330
Leaving Shamiko stuck inside
of that nightmare isn't an option.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:03.040
Because I'll be too ashamed
to ever look her in the face again if we do.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.420
And... I'd hate that.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.710
It would take days and days for me
to find her on my own.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.460
And since I'm still sealed away,
the best I can offer is pinpoint navigation.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.080
Then we just need to break the ancient seal!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:17.460
Fwoop...

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.830
Will my blood be enough to do it? How many gallons?

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.500
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:22.670
Put down the wand!

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:26.500
The blood of one little whippersnapper like you
isn't enough to fully break a seal that's thousands of years old!

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.250
Don't be so rash, Momo!

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.460
Let's figure out a different way!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:29.830
A different way?

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.080
I'm sorry.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:37.540
Going back to the real world with you
is too difficult for me to pull off right now.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:38.460
Why's that?

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:42.170
My current form is like a mirage
that was born from your memories.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:43.830
It's going to vanish soon.

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:47.790
Also, you don't have to look for my core
because it's embedded inside you.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.500
Oh, how about that! It's inside of me!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.330
Huh?

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.330
WHAT DID YOU SAY?!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.580
Don't raise your voice or it'll make me disappear!

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.580
How?! When?! Why?!

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.040
H-h-h-h-h-how did that happen?!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:02.080
Uh, let's see, how best to explain this...

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:07.170
I'm borrowing your brain to talk to you right now,
so I can't describe it in very much detail.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.420
Uh, okay...

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.580
<b>Okay...</b>

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:13.330
It's going to be easier for you to comprehend
through first-hand experience

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.920
instead of me trying to use your limited vocabulary.

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:18.040
For the time being, let's continue searching
for your memory of 10 years ago.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:18.790
Huh?!

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:22.130
This is a good opportunity for you
to learn how to use and control your powers!

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.290
W-wait!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:27.040
I'm not ready to move on yet!
What do you mean your core is embedded in me?!

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:27.790
Pat!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.500
C'mon! It's time to shift gears and get focused!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.830
But I can't!

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:34.380
Everything's okay. Just take it easy.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.790
Okay. Face forward and grab onto the rod.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.250
Try going back through your memories.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.670
I was so glad you managed to find that rod.

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.080
Our wavelengths were miraculously in tune
when you were at the factory ruins,

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.580
so I was able to communicate with you.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.830
So that was your voice I heard...

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.710
I wasn't just hallucinating it.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:02.080
Even though you've closed your eyes,
you should feel like your mind's eye is wide open.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:06.380
Imagine you're a drop of water falling from the tip
of a concentrated mass of consciousness

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:07.380
into a pool of memories.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:11.460
Then just go whamo-blamo, bingo-bango
and you'll find it!

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.880
I don't really understand
what you meant by that second part.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:19.330
When you feel a WHAM, follow it with a BAM,
and then SHAZAM! You're done!

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.250
Focus...

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.580
Gotta stay focused...

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:30.380
Ten years ago, you were in far worse shape
than Seiko thought you were.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:34.500
Your soul had been ravaged by the curse
and was worn down to almost nothing.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.920
The treatment I provided
was just to give her peace of mind.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:43.130
Later on, when I was reduced to my core and about
to run out of the magic needed to maintain my cat form,

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:45.290
you suddenly came to my mind.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.380
Wh-where are we now?

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:54.500
This seems like the right spot. You pulled it off!

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.670
<b>YUKO YOSHIDA</b>

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.750
Pardon the intrusion...

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.580
Little Yuko...

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:07.380
The kind girl who took on
my younger sister's share of the curse.

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:10.920
No more disasters should befall this city,
at least for a while.

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:12.630
And so...

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.630
I will entrust you with my core.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:22.920
I'm going to use it to help sustain your life.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:30.210
Please... stay healthy.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:34.170
So my life is being sustained
because of the core that you put inside me?

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.920
Yes. That's why I can't go back with you right now.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.420
I'm almost out of time.

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:40.000
What?!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:43.790
The stash of magic power that I've been sapping
from you on a daily basis has just run dry.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:44.580
WHAAAAT?!

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:48.460
That's too cruel! There are still so many things
I want to ask and get your help with!

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:49.960
W-wait!

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:53.830
I have to bring you back to Momo!
Because she'll never smile if I don't!

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:57.130
Please! I'm going to lose sight
of what I've worked so hard for!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:58.130
It's all right.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.170
Momo doesn't really need me or the city anymore,

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:05.210
because I get the impression
that she's found something more important.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:08.040
It won't be long until you see her smile.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:12.040
Let's have another chat after I've stored up
enough of your magic power.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:15.710
It'll make you feel a tad sleepy every day,
but please forgive me.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:17.250
B-but that's not...

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:19.920
Relax. The day will come when we can remove my core.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:25.000
You just need to become a super powerful demon
and conquer the curse that's inflicting you.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.580
Then I won't have to sustain your life anymore.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.540
That sounds way too hard!

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:31.920
It's super-duper hard.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.630
But things may proceed smoother than you think.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:35.630
Huh?!

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:36.330
Also...

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:38.330
Come here for a second.

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:41.710
I have one more favor to ask of you.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:46.290
If we want to rescue Shamiko quickly,

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:49.040
then we need somebody who can move around
and locate her inside the dream.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:53.830
And it needs to be someone with strong magic
who I won't lose track of due to a little interference.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:57.750
On top of that, their soul needs to be tuned
to a near familial frequency with Shamiko's

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:59.630
or else it'll be too unstable.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.080
Someone who's almost family and has strong magic...

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.210
I have an idea!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.040
Huh?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.290
Ms. Sakura... she's gone now.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:16.790
I have one more favor to ask of you.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.330
Okay! Time to figure out a way home!

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:25.290
I'll just keep moving and putting the smack down
on my bad memories until I eventually get out of here!

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.710
And after I get back in one piece,
I'm gonna use this weapon to eat pancakes!

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.880
I'm destined to become a super strong demon,
so this should be a easy-peasy!

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:40.380
Stomp, stomp, stomp, stomp, stomp, stomp!

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:33.670
Huh?

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.500
I lied! It's totally not easy-peasy!

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:40.380
<b>stomp</b>

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:40.380
<b>stomp</b>

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:40.380
<b>stomp</b>

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:40.380
<b>stomp</b>

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:41.880
<b>UGH...</b>

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:41.500
Ugh...

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:45.330
<b>LOOOOOM...</b>

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.790
Ugh!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:49.880
I just realized something. A weapon is absolutely useless
if the person using it doesn't have any stamina left!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.210
A demonic lesson learned!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.170
I guess this is the end.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.500
Don't think this means you've...!

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:56.290
<b>BOOOOM</b>

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:57.170
Never give uuuuup!

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.130
Huh?

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:35.210
I'm here to bring you back, Shamiko!

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.380
M-Momo?!

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:37.830
How did you get here?!

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:40.250
And is it just me or are you looking kinda dark?

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.000
I came over to the dark side.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.670
I AM SO LOST RIGHT NOW!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.580
Dark side?! What is going on?!

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.920
In order for me to reach you here,
I had to become your vassal...

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:52.540
Huh?!

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:54.790
You're hurt! Are you okay?!

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.380
Oh, yeah, those are just... uh... old wounds.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.500
Oh really? What a relief.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:04.670
Anyways, you look so awesome right now!
This is so much better than your usual look!

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:00.750
<b>HYPE</b>

